       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. GCDRECURSIVESTYLE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 A PIC 9(4) VALUE 48.
       01 B PIC 9(4) VALUE 18.
       01 TEMP PIC 9(4).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM COMPUTE-GCD UNTIL B = 0
           DISPLAY "GCD: " A
           STOP RUN.

       COMPUTE-GCD.
           COMPUTE TEMP = FUNCTION MOD(A, B)
           MOVE B TO A
           MOVE TEMP TO B.
